 412:D:/Program Files/msys64/mingw64/arm-none-eabi/include/c++/13.3.0/bits\stl_vector.h ****    *  @tparam _Tp  Type of element.
 413:D:/Program Files/msys64/mingw64/arm-none-eabi/include/c++/13.3.0/bits\stl_vector.h ****    *  @tparam _Alloc  Allocator type, defaults to allocator<_Tp>.
 414:D:/Program Files/msys64/mingw64/arm-none-eabi/include/c++/13.3.0/bits\stl_vector.h ****    *
 415:D:/Program Files/msys64/mingw64/arm-none-eabi/include/c++/13.3.0/bits\stl_vector.h ****    *  Meets the requirements of a <a href="tables.html#65">container</a>, a
 416:D:/Program Files/msys64/mingw64/arm-none-eabi/include/c++/13.3.0/bits\stl_vector.h ****    *  <a href="tables.html#66">reversible container</a>, and a
 417:D:/Program Files/msys64/mingw64/arm-none-eabi/include/c++/13.3.0/bits\stl_vector.h ****    *  <a href="tables.html#67">sequence</a>, including the
 418:D:/Program Files/msys64/mingw64/arm-none-eabi/include/c++/13.3.0/bits\stl_vector.h ****    *  <a href="tables.html#68">optional sequence requirements</a> with the
 419:D:/Program Files/msys64/mingw64/arm-none-eabi/include/c++/13.3.0/bits\stl_vector.h ****    *  %exception of @c push_front and @c pop_front.
 420:D:/Program Files/msys64/mingw64/arm-none-eabi/include/c++/13.3.0/bits\stl_vector.h ****    *
 421:D:/Program Files/msys64/mingw64/arm-none-eabi/include/c++/13.3.0/bits\stl_vector.h ****    *  In some terminology a %vector can be described as a dynamic
 422:D:/Program Files/msys64/mingw64/arm-none-eabi/include/c++/13.3.0/bits\stl_vector.h ****    *  C-style array, it offers fast and efficient access to individual
 423:D:/Program Files/msys64/mingw64/arm-none-eabi/include/c++/13.3.0/bits\stl_vector.h ****    *  elements in any order and saves the user from worrying about
 424:D:/Program Files/msys64/mingw64/arm-none-eabi/include/c++/13.3.0/bits\stl_vector.h ****    *  memory and size allocation.  Subscripting ( @c [] ) access is
 425:D:/Program Files/msys64/mingw64/arm-none-eabi/include/c++/13.3.0/bits\stl_vector.h ****    *  also provided as with C-style arrays.
 426:D:/Program Files/msys64/mingw64/arm-none-eabi/include/c++/13.3.0/bits\stl_vector.h ****   */
